      "rationale": "This macro-like equation defines the named loopCondition proof term by its exact translated comparison expression.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-4be6d834df0a8ee3bb5d58a2a5bb59649a9cae271802ea3bd5625e3ac813ad59",
      "start_line": 29,
      "text": "  rule loopCondition()\n       => Compare(Name(\"i\"), CmpOp(\"<=\", Name(\"n\")))"
    },
