      "rationale": "This structural equation defines targetBody as the exact translated statement sequence used in the proof.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-fb6161a8b67f7d15461a9dae303daf34e9e07a0cb359e367e07282d505d6e0cb",
      "start_line": 41,
      "text": "  rule targetBody()\n       => If(\n            Compare(Name(\"n\"), CmpOp(\"<\", Int(0))),\n            Return(Str(\"\")),\n            .Stmts)\n          Assign(Name(\"result\"), Str(\"0\"))\n          Assign(Name(\"i\"), Int(1))\n          While(loopCondition(), loopBody())\n          Return(Name(\"result\"))"
